NOTICE
======

OpenCode for Android
An Android runtime that runs the official OpenCode desktop application unmodified.


WHAT THIS IS
------------

This is not a mobile version of OpenCode, and nothing in OpenCode's interface has been
rewritten, reskinned, renamed, or re-iconed.

The desktop application's interface and engine are loaded and run **as published by their
authors**. The renderer's files are byte-identical to the official build. What this project
provides is the host layer around them - a GeckoView session to render into, a local server
that serves the bundled files, a proxy for the engine's API and terminal socket, bridge
scripts that supply the host capabilities the desktop app expects, and Android permission
and lifecycle handling.

That layer sits outside the official program, not inside it. Nothing in the official build
was patched to make this work.

This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by
OpenCode or Anomaly.


